SDE WM: wide caption buttons that follow the title font.

New themerc keys (ignored by stock Openbox, so SDE themes still load there):
  window.button.width.percent   button width, percent of the title height
  window.button.height.percent  button height, percent of the title height (100 = full)
  window.button.spacing         pixels between buttons and before the right edge
The title height follows the window title font, which SDE scales with the
interface size, so the buttons grow on HiDPI screens. Without the keys the
buttons keep the Openbox size (label height - 2) and spacing (padding.width + 1).

--- a/obrender/theme.h
+++ b/obrender/theme.h
@@ -59,6 +59,11 @@
     gint label_height;
     gint title_height;
     gint button_size;
+    /* SDE: caption button area (window.button.width/height.percent of the
+       title height, window.button.spacing pixels); button_size otherwise */
+    gint button_width;
+    gint button_height;
+    gint button_spacing;
     gint grip_width;
     gint menu_title_label_height;
     gint menu_title_height;
